    <div class="policy-section">
      <div class="policy-number">1</div>
      <p class="policy-text">When you sign up, we collect your name, birthday, contact number, email, address, student ID, course, year level, GPA, family background, and income details. We also collect documents you upload and basic session info like your device and browser.</p>
