      <p class="policy-text">Only you and authorized Iskolarly admins can see your data. We don't sell it or share it with anyone outside the platform, except when the law requires it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <div class="policy-number">4</div>
      <p class="policy-text">Your password is encrypted and never stored as plain text. We take reasonable steps to keep your account and data secure. Keep your login credentials private.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
      <div class="policy-number">5</div>
      <p class="policy-text">You have the right to view, correct, or request deletion of your data under the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173). Contact us through the platform to do so.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="policy-section">
